     "body": "<p>Just try to reproduce it, get  /foo#contributor as expect.</p>\n\n<p>1. curl -X PUT \"http://localhost:8080/rest/foo\"<br/>\n2. curl -i -X PATCH -H \"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\" --data-binary \"@body.rdf\" \"http://localhost:8080/rest/foo\"</p>\n\n<p>Screenshot and body.rdf attached.</p>",
